      "type": "feature",
      "status": "in_review",
      "priority": "high",
      "title": "Implement local TTS generation bridge",
      "description": "Create the Tauri backend command layer for basic text-to-speech generation. Accept text and selected voice/model options, invoke the local engine, write audio output to app storage, and return generation status and file path to the Nuxt UI.",
